      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeriko ekaba ekingiirwe kimwe ahabw'okutiina Abaisraeli; tihaine waabaire naashohora n'obu kwakuba okutaaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.5.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 5:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.5.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: Reeba, nkuhaire Yeriko n'omugabe waayo n'abashaija baayo amamanzi g'amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe mwena, abashaija abarwani, nimwija kweziguurutsya orurembo omurundi gumwe; mukore mutyo amazooba mukaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 7:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 10:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi abanyamurwa mushanju nibaija kutwara enzamba mushanju z'amahembe g'empaya z'entaama, beebembere eshanduukye y'endagaano; aha izooba rya mushanju muziguurukye orurembo emirundi mushanju, obwo abanyamurwa nibateera enzamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baraateere enzamba y'akasirikiriro n'eihembe ry'empaya y'entaama, naimwe mwahurira eiraka ryayo, abantu boona bateerere hamwe orwari; ahonaaho orugo rw'amabaare rw'orurembo nirwija kukumbagara, rugwe ahansi, buri muntu arutembere ahu araabe yaahika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yoshua mwene Nuuni yaayeta abanyamurwa, yaabagira ati: Muheekye eshanduukye y'endagaano, kandi n'abanyamurwa mushanju batware enzamba mushanju z'amahembe g'empaya z'entaama beebembere eshanduukye ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaagambira abantu ati: Mwimukye, muziguurukye orurembo, abaine eby'okurwanisa barabeho beebembere eshanduukye ya MUKAMA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua ku yaaherize kugambira abantu, abanyamurwa mushanju abaabaire baine enzamba mushanju z'amahembe g'empaya z'entaama omu maisho ga Mukama baagyenda omu maisho, nibateera enzamba, eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA ebakuratiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashaija abaabaire baine eby'okurwanisa baayebembera abanyamurwa abaabaire nibateera enzamba; ab'enyima baakuratira eshanduukye, obwo enzamba zigumiizemu nizigamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua yaaragiira abantu ati: Mutateera orwari, n'amaraka gaanyu gatahurirwa, kandi hatagira owaateeza, okuhitsya aha izooba eri ndaabaragiirireho kuteera orwari; obwo nibwo muraaruteere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo yaaziguurutsya eshanduukye ya MUKAMA orurembo omurundi gumwe; baagaruka omu rusiisira, baaraaramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yoshua yaaguruka kare omu kasheeshe, abanyamurwa baaheeka eshanduukye ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.15.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 15:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'abanyamurwa mushanju, abaabaire baine enzamba mushanju z'amahembe g'empaya z'entaama beebembeire eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, baarabaho, baagumizamu nibateera enzamba; n'abashaija abaabaire baine eby'okurwanisa baabeebembera, ab'enyima baakuratira eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, obwo enzamba nizigamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'aha izooba rya kabiri baaziguuruka orurembo omurundi gumwe; baagaruka omu rusiisira rwabo. Baamara ebiro mukaaga nibakora batyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha izooba rya mushanju baimuka kare omushekye nigujuguta, baaziguuruka orurembo, nk'oku baabaire nibagira; kwonka aha izooba eryo baaruziguuruka emirundi mushanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.7.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 7:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.13.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 13:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aha murundi gwa mushanju, abanyamurwa ku baateire enzamba, Yoshua yaagambira abantu ati: Muteere orwari! ahakuba orurembo MUKAMA yaarubaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 2:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15:6",
