        },
        {
          "text": " Ahonaaho abantu baateera orwari, n'enzamba zaateerwa. Abantu ku baahuriire eiraka ry'enzamba, baateera munonga orwari, orugo rwakumbagara, rwagwa ahansi, batyo abantu baarutemberaho, baataaha omu rurembo, omuntu weena ahu yaabaire yaahika, baarukwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
